  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing a Local Prospecting Tool**\n\nI\'m currently focused on designing a custom tool for local prospecting as a freelancer. My initial thought process involves extracting leads within a specific sector by scraping from web search and maps. The next step is personalizing a generic email template for each chosen prospect, leveraging Gemini for information-based customization.\n\n\n**Defining the Technical Stack**\n\nI\'m now determining the optimal tech stack for this project. I envision a responsive, custom dashboard using a bento grid, prioritizing a mobile-first approach. Subtle animations, powered by motion, will enhance user interactions within a clean, modern, and uncluttered interface. I\'m prioritizing essential text and labels for a streamlined experience. I\'ve also integrated the Gmail feature, and am setting up OAuth using Google Workspace Skills. The scope needed is gmail.compose, so I will prepare for using `set_up_oauth`.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 1
      nanos: 768773094
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
